          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Recall that a tenth is 0.1, a hundredth is 0.01, and so on. Find the following products in tenths, hundredths and so on: (a) 6 × 4 tenths = 24 tenths (b) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "7 \\times 0 . 3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (c) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "9 \\times 5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hundredths"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.24,
            0.373,
            0.335
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Find the products: (a) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 7 . 3 4 \\times 6"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (b) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4 . 2 3 \\times 3 . 7"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (c) "
            },
            {
